<title>USA: SOCCER-GUATEMALA DEFEATS COSTA RICA IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GUATEMALA DEFEATS COSTA RICA IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guatemala beat Costa Rica</p>
<p>1-0 (halftime 1-0) in a CONCACAF Group A World Cup qualifying</p>
<p>match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Guatemala - Juan Plata (penalty 34th minute)</p>
<p>Costa Rica - none</p>
<p>Attendance: 22,727</p>
</text>
